The packet capture file http-12328064.pcap shows the traffic that was captured between the Windows client 192.168.56.1 and the OpenWRT server 192.168.56.2. When the user clicks on the link, the browser issued a request for / then /12328064.html, since the new HTML page contained a reference to the external stylesheet /mystyle.css. All servers returned a 200 OK response code, indicating that the files were located and returned without problem. When clicking on the date/time button, no new HTTP request would be created, since Date() is executed within the browser as JavaScript.




